      "instance_name": "bullying",
      "label": "bullying",
      "description": "The concept of bullying as a social issue involving repeated aggressive behavior towards a perceived weaker individual or group. This is a real-world social phenomenon that the meme references to convey its message. The meme uses the metaphor of a dog (pug) being bullied by a cat to represent real-life bullying dynamics.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_15793903"
