      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "cat_as_bully",
      "label": "cat as bully",
      "description": "The implicit reference to a cat as a symbol of a bully or aggressor in the context of animal behavior and human social dynamics. Cats are often stereotyped in popular culture as aloof, territorial, or aggressive, which makes them a fitting (though metaphorical) symbol for a bully in this meme.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
