      "label": "vulnerability and empathy",
      "description": "The emotional appeal in the meme relies on the viewer’s empathy for the injured pug, which is a real-world social and psychological phenomenon. The image uses the pug’s sad expression and injury to evoke sympathy and encourage the viewer to act as an advocate for the victim.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
