      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the intervention request scene",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the scene where the pug is requesting intervention regarding bullying. The text 'will you tell the cat bullying is not okay?' directly addresses the viewer with 'you', making the user the implied agent who is being asked to take action. The user is projected onto the scene of the pug's plea, which is the central interactive element of the meme.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
